# Journal writing (ghostwriter)

When creating or editing files under `content/`, follow the author’s voice defined in **`WRITING_STYLE.md`** at the repository root (UK English on new work; match existing spelling when editing legacy posts; personal + teaching tone; direct “you”; firm opinions; dry wit about tools only).

If `WRITING_STYLE.md` conflicts with a one-off author instruction in chat, **obey the chat instruction** for that task.
